samaritan healer woman~
a samaritan healer~
This healer attends to the wounded.
~
This woman is doing her best to sooth the wounds of the deserters as well as
make them as comfortable as possible. It is hard to tell how many of these men
she had to watch die since they arrived. She doesn't seem to have any
particular affiliation, she only wants to help those that need it.
~
