shaking soldier~
a shaking soldier~
This battle fatigued soldier is shaking constantly.
~
This poor soldier must have seen some horrid things. While he is a bit banged
up you can see no evidence of any major blow yet he is constantly shaking and
mumbling about the blood, and the sounds,  and the fearsome cries of
Battlesisters.  Few can look that much carnage in the eye and remain
unchanged.
~
